learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T20:17:49.780Z","harness:codex","Pending inspection does not prove absence of effects. Keep reconciliation opt-in for generic domain adapters and persist attribution for every internal writer. Compensation needs an exact history address plus verified ownership, not timestamp equality; neutral sibling compensation remains auditable and must not be mistaken for a peer edit."
